{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/cda8cffe518a7aa6ecc5df3d4584d63b.avif?t=1772449296\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kawasiro Nitori created a multiplayer online MMO game and promoted it on TV. Remlia thought this was a good opportunity for the whole Gensokyo to worship her fame without leaving her house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: main Chapter (10 chapters), side stages, special stages, challenge stages, Clearance Bonus, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last three chapters will be released as free updates after the game is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter contains about 5-6 main stages;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/4df19caac966a4a989d7fe1ad4447cbd.avif?t=1772449296\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters are \u300c<strong>the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong>\u300d; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more characters will join as the main story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 characters can be used finally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/67a1a555fa1bea6b68238f3b49d56511.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1000 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/22127c71b199bbae3d6df68ca41fc620.avif?t=1772449296\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character upgrade, character talent, weapon proficiency and level, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapon skills, equipment .etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through character cultivation, and the combination of different professional cultivation, equipped skills, etc., skill matching is carried out to finally create a hexagonal warrior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports two modes: [Fixed Point Addition] and [Random Point Addition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/cbe3bce141463333bf44ab3279268800.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1000 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/c1f5f3a3352b8b6a0012abb566640d9a.avif?t=1772449296\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In base , you can control the movement of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infrastructure and some subsequent gameplay will focus on the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/9ee32deebe9fbe58a348e58a11b4ba8e.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/c8b388326683149b49c20b4e2481cc41.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to basic gameplay, levels include map skills, map events, tarot card systems, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be different levels and gameplay gradually opening up with the main storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/3530859577552a561134aa4cf66da3d3.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1200 height=675 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/a71114fc6b54fe82391f3602334baede.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official version includes some Bgm of Touhou Project:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u4ea1\u304d\u738b\u5973\u306e\u70ba\u306e\u30bb\u30d7\u30c6\u30c3\u30c8\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u5f7c\u5cb8\u5e30\u822a\u3000\uff5e Riverside View\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u6642\u4ee3\u89aa\u7236\u3068\u30cf\u30a4\u30ab\u30e9\u5c11\u5973\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u3010\u30d5\u30e9\u30ef\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u30ca\u30a4\u30c8\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u82a5\u5ddd\u9f8d\u4e4b\u4ecb\u306e\u6cb3\u7ae5\u3000\uff5e Candid Friend\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u3010\u30ad\u30e3\u30d7\u30c6\u30f3\u30fb\u30e0\u30e9\u30b5\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010U.N.\u30aa\u30fc\u30a8\u30f3\u306f\u5f7c\u5973\u306a\u306e\u304b\uff1f\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u5e73\u5b89\u306e\u30a8\u30a4\u30ea\u30a2\u30f3\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u6708\u307e\u3067\u5c4a\u3051\u3001\u4e0d\u6b7b\u306e\u7159\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u30d6\u30af\u30ec\u30b7\u30e5\u30c6\u30a3\u306e\u4eba\u5f62\u5e2b\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u72c2\u6c17\u306e\u77b3\u3000\uff5e Invisible Full Moon\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u3010\u4e0a\u6d77\u7d05\u8336\u9928\u3000\uff5e Chinese Tea\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u304a\u3066\u3093\u3070\u604b\u5a18\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u30cf\u30eb\u30c8\u30de\u30f3\u306e\u5996\u602a\u5c11\u5973\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u8f1d\u304f\u91dd\u306e\u5c0f\u4eba\u65cf\u3000\uff5e Little Princess\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u4e8c\u8272\u84ee\u82b1\u8776\u3000\uff5e Red and White\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u4eca\u6614\u5e7b\u60f3\u90f7\u3000\uff5e Flower Land\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u3010\u6708\u6642\u8a08 \uff5e\u30eb\u30ca\u30fb\u30c0\u30a4\u30a2\u30eb\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u604b\u8272\u30de\u30b8\u30c3\u30af\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u3010\u30e9\u30af\u30c8\u30ac\u30fc\u30eb \uff5e \u5c11\u5973\u5bc6\u5ba4\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t      \t\u3010\u5c11\u5973\u3055\u3068\u308a\u3000\uff5e 3rd eye\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u5e83\u6709\u5c04\u602a\u9ce5\u4e8b\u3000\uff5e Till When?\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\t\u4f50\u6e21\u306e\u4e8c\u30c3\u5ca9\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010Bad Apple!!\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u98a8\u795e\u5c11\u5973\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u30ea\u30d0\u30fc\u30b9\u30a4\u30c7\u30aa\u30ed\u30ae\u30fc  -Reverse Ideology-\u3011\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \t\u3010\u771f\u591c\u4e2d\u306e\u30d5\u30a7\u30a2\u30ea\u30fc\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u4fe1\u4ef0\u306f\u511a\u304d\u4eba\u9593\u306e\u70ba\u306b\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t      \t\u3010\u4ea1\u5931\u306e\u30a8\u30e2\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u5076\u50cf\u306b\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u59d4\u306d\u3066\u3000\uff5e Idoratrize World\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u7815\u6708\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u83ef\u306e\u3055\u304b\u3065\u304d\u5927\u6c5f\u5c71\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t      \t\u3010\u5c11\u5973\u7dba\u60f3\u66f2\u3000\uff5e Dream Battle\u3011\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u3010\u6709\u9802\u5929\u5909\u3000\uff5e Wonderful Heaven\u3011\t      \t\t      \t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/2a00e1cae78d9ddc02481e08efa5bfd2.avif?t=1772449296\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About -Class change-, Class-change without appearance change is rasl Class-change . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So each character will have multiple sets of professional appearances,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please forgive the time cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >